  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, The speed of proton,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5.0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />The magnetic field, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math><br /><br />Angle <math><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Charge on the proton, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math><br /><br />When the proton enters in magnitude field, it experiences a magnetic force<br /><br /><math><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>B</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8.0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>13&#160;</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>",
